window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A piece of paper destroyed me. </p> <p>It was one day...one moment...one letter. </p> <p>One lie. </p> <p>That's all it took to change the course of my life. </p> <p>Now he's back. And he thinks I'm the one who broke him. </p> <p>Someone is lying. </p> <p>And it's not me. But it's not him either. </p> <p>We need to learn to trust again. </p> <p>Sometimes, however, I think trust should be considered a four-letter word. </p> <p>Get this sexy romance now. </p> <p><i>Due to adult language and sexual situations, this book is intended for mature audiences.</i> </p> <p>Note to listeners: This book is a stand-alone novel. It is the first book in a series that follows three sisters. Most enjoyable listening order: <i>Purple Orchids, White Lilies, Black Roses</i> </p>"; 
